Controllers\ must\ not\ depend\ on\ TableRecord,\ Database\ or\ jOOQ=d2202330-01bd-4631-965d-0cde5217ae91
Layered\ architecture\ considering\ only\ dependencies\ in\ layers,\ consisting\ of\ (optional)\nlayer\ 'Controller'\ ('com.example.handler..',\ 'com.example.processor..',\ 'com.example.route..',\ 'com.example.servlet..')\nlayer\ 'Service'\ ('com.example.tableapi..',\ 'com.example.storage..',\ 'com.example.scheduler..',\ 'com.example.datasource..',\ 'com.example.extlib..',\ 'com.example.mongo..',\ 'com.example.script..',\ 'com.example.module..')\nlayer\ 'Model'\ ('com.example.record..',\ 'com.example.repository..',\ 'com.example.config..',\ 'com.example.model..')\nlayer\ 'View'\ ()\nwhere\ layer\ 'Controller'\ may\ not\ be\ accessed\ by\ any\ layer\nwhere\ layer\ 'Service'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Controller',\ 'Service']\nwhere\ layer\ 'View'\ may\ only\ be\ accessed\ by\ layers\ ['Controller']\nwhere\ layer\ 'View'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Model']\nwhere\ layer\ 'Model'\ may\ only\ access\ layers\ ['Model']=93d5518b-d731-4be7-ae70-bebe343e42c6
